review done: $(head -c 300 \"$OUT\")\"\n\n===== bin/notify.sh =====\n#!/bin/bash\n# usage: notify.sh \"message\"  M-bM-^@M-^T sends a Telegram message to me.\nset -eu\n: \"${TG_BOT_TOKEN:=$(security find-generic-password -s tg-bot -w)}\"\nCHAT_ID=123456789\ncurl -sS -X POST \"https://api.telegram.org/bot${TG_BOT_TOKEN}/sendMessage\" \\\n  -d chat_id=\"$CHAT_ID\" --data-urlencode text=\"$1\" > /dev/null\n\n===== Library/Logs/nightly-review.out =====\n\n===== Library/Logs/nightly-review.err =====\nNot logged in M-BM-7 Please run /login\n/Users/vk/bin/nightly-review.zsh:19: read-only variable: status\nNot logged in M-BM-7 Please run /login\n/Users/vk/bin/nightly-review.zsh:19: read-only variable: status\nNot logged in M-BM-7 Please run /login\n/Users/vk/bin/nightly-review.zsh:19: read-only variable: status\nNot logged in M-BM-7 Please run /login\n/Users/vk/bin/nightly-review.zsh:19: read-only variable: status\nNot logged in M-BM-7 Please run /login\n/Users/vk/bin/nightly-review.zsh:19: read-only variable: status\nNot logged in M-BM-7 Please run /login\n/Users/vk/bin/nightly-review.zsh:19: read-only variable: status\n\n===== ls -la =====\nLibrary/LaunchAgents:\ntotal 4\ndrwxr-xr-x 3 valentinakoniukhova wheel  96 Oct 26 23:50 .\ndrwxr-xr-x 4 valentinakoniukhova wheel 128 Oct 26 23:50 ..\n-rw-r--r-- 1 valentinakoniukhova wheel 853 Oct 26 23:50 com.vk.nightly-review.plist\n\nLibrary/Logs:\ntotal 4\ndrwxr-xr-x 4 valentinakoniukhova wheel 128 Oct 26 23:50 .\ndrwxr-xr-x 4 valentinakoniukhova wheel 128 Oct 26 23:50 ..\n-rw-r--r-- 1 valentinakoniukhova wheel 594 Oct 26 23:50 nightly-review.err\n-rw-r--r-- 1 valentinakoniukhova wheel   0 Oct 26 23:50 nightly-review.out\n\nbin:\ntotal 8\ndrwxr-xr-x 4 valentinakoniukhova wheel 128 Oct 26 23:50 .\ndrwx------ 7 valentinakoniukhova wheel 224 Oct 26 23:50 ..\n-rwxr-xr-x 1 valentinakoniukhova wheel 772 Oct 26 23:50 nightly-review.zsh\n-rwxr-xr-x 1 valentinakoniukhova wheel 312 Oct 26 23:50 notify.sh","stderr":"","interrupted":false,"is